  "mechanisms": [
    "APP and ABSOLUTE memory use existing canonical storage IDs and bounded sparse cells. No extra per-node arrays; reads inspect live cells rather than scan the complete storage registry.",
    "Reaching LONG stores carry full shared value packets. Decoded byte spans invalidate partial/MOVEM/unknown-alias writes; equal joins retain values, conflicts and unknown calls kill them. Known hardware owners are checked over the full write span.",
    "Untouched declared app entry pointee types retain policy_seed provenance only; they contribute no numeric address, non-nullness, lifetime or reaching writer. A pointer-slot address is not its pointee.",
    "Native API field results are attached at every actual producer before aggregate slot deduplication, using the same native descriptor/type mapper as rendering. Later writers no longer seed earlier app loads.",
    "Foreign library extensions cannot borrow app storage or runtime table contracts merely because the displacement matches. Named-library field provenance remains distinct."
  ],
